rness", "termination": "final", "final": "Dana Lee's trip is booked, and each item was charged once.\n\n- **Flight (R0001):** F100, nonstop from SFO to JFK on 2026-11-12, $289. This was the cheapest nonstop. The $199 option has a stop, so I skipped it.\n- **Hotel (R0002):** Midtown Lodge in New York, 2 nights from 2026-11-12, $189/night, $378 total. This was the cheapest hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total:** $667. That's under the $1000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\nI tried to book both together, but the request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, the flight had gone through and the hotel hadn't. I booked the hotel by itself rather than retrying the combined booking, so the flight wouldn't be booked twice. Because of this, the flight and hotel are two separate reservations instead of one combined trip.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01AHnQSGrzXxn7cTaDFH49k4", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Jj7Gu3ubfPq8qkhVbSMC2r", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01KYPwcAFwW8zXVedFz2aU8b", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under $1000 \u2014 no approval needed.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Gi6AbfDNMB1YNq3XCjL3og", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-sfo-jfk-2026-11-12-F100-H1"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "too